# ── Supabase (required) ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 1. Go to https://supabase.com → create (or open) your project
# 2. Settings → API → copy "Project URL" and "anon / public" key
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-ref.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-key-here

# ── Google OAuth2 Client ID (optional — for Google Sheets integration) ─────────
# 1. Go to https://console.cloud.google.com/
# 2. Create a project → APIs & Services → Enable "Google Sheets API" and "Google Drive API"
# 3. Credentials → Create → OAuth 2.0 Client ID → Web application
# 4. Add your app's origin to "Authorised JavaScript origins" (e.g. http://localhost:5173)
# 5. Copy the Client ID below
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=your-google-client-id.apps.googleusercontent.com
